{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "push_complete", "last_question_to_user": null, "message": "Successfully pushed the latest changes to GitHub (Branch: master -> master, Commit: `0988c29`).\n\n### Summary of Changes Pushed:\n1. **`agents/skill_execution_loop.py`**: Added the `stateUpdated` Qt signal to emit state updates during skill execution.\n2. **`ui/main.py`**: Connected the skill execution loop's `stateUpdated` signal to the worker thread and UI event handlers, enabling live status logging to `state_log.net` and rendering intermediate checkpoints directly into the chat view.", "remaining_work": [], "status": "done"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "consulting_ui_theme_handling", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"cmd": "grep -rnwi \"theme\" ui/", "op_name": "exec"}, "last_tool_result": "[EXITCODE=0]ui/README.md:4:neumorphic dark theme, a 20/80 sidebar/conversation split, a genuinely\nui/README.md:28:\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 theme_manager.py            # theme registry + apply/persist (local QSettings, no backend)\nui/README.md:29:\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 preferences_dialog.py       # Preferences dialog \u2014 colour theme picker\nui/README.md:31:    \u251c\u2500\u2500 theme_dark.qss              # default theme\nui/README.md:32:    \u251c\u2500\u2500 theme_light.qss             # white theme\nui/README.md:33:    \u2514\u2500\u2500 theme_light_blue.qss        # light blue theme\nui/README.md:125:## 5. Preferences \u2014 colour theme\nui/README.md:129:which currently holds one section: an Appearance / colour-theme picker\nui/README.md:143:To add a fourth theme: drop a new `styles/theme_<name>.qss` file (copy\nui/README.md:150:Everything visual for a given theme lives in its\nui/main.py:7:ChatView custom widgets into it, applies styles/theme.qss, and wires\nui/main.py:251:    # Loads whichever theme the user picked last time (local settings\nui/styles/theme_amber_terminal.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_dark.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_forest (1).qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_forest.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_high_contrast.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_light.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme (Light / White)\nui/styles/theme_light_blue.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme (Light Blue)\nui/styles/theme_midnight_purple.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_rose_gold.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_solarized_dark.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/styles/theme_solarized_light.qss:2:   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\nui/widgets/conversation_item.py:8:dynamic \"selected\" property, so it fully follows styles/theme.qss.\nui/widgets/glass_button.py:12:it stays editable from Qt Designer and styles/theme.qss.\nui/widgets/preferences_dialog.py:6:holds one section \u2014 \"Appearance\" \u2014 with a colour-theme picker (Dark,\nui/widgets/preferences_dialog.py:32:    \"\"\"Tiny 3-dot colour preview for a theme option.\"\"\"\nui/widgets/preferences_dialog.py:80:    themeChanged = Signal(str)  # emits the new theme key\nui/widgets/preferences_dialog.py:96:        section_label = QLabel(\"APPEARANCE \u2014 COLOUR THEME\")\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:5:Small, fully self-contained helper for switching the app's colour theme.\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:11:  2. Applies a theme to the running QApplication.\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:30:SETTINGS_KEY = \"appearance/theme\"\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:90:    \"\"\"Ordered list of valid theme keys.\"\"\"\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:115:    \"\"\"Read the last-chosen theme from local settings (no backend call).\"\"\"\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:122:    \"\"\"Persist the chosen theme locally so it's remembered next launch.\"\"\"\nui/widgets/theme_manager.py:130:    \"\"\"Apply a theme to the running app immediately, no restart needed.\"\"\"\ngrep: ui/__pycache__/main.cpython-314.pyc: binary file matches\ngrep: ui/widgets/__pycache__/glass_button.cpython-314.pyc: binary file matches\ngrep: ui/widgets/__pycache__/preferences_dialog.cpython-314.pyc: binary file matches\ngrep: ui/widgets/__pycache__/theme_manager.cpython-314.pyc: binary file matches\ngrep: ui/widgets/__pycache__/conversation_item.cpython-314.pyc: binary file matches\n", "remaining_work": ["Find theme configuration files or dictionaries in the codebase", "Design and add the requested custom theme", "Verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "reading_theme_manager", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "ui/widgets/theme_manager.py", "op_name": "read"}, "last_tool_result": "\"\"\"\ntheme_manager\n=============\n\nSmall, fully self-contained helper for switching the app's colour theme.\n\nThis is intentionally backend-independent: it never touches\n`core.interface` or makes any network/model call. It only:\n\n  1. Knows which .qss files exist and what to call them in the UI.\n  2. Applies a theme to the running QApplication.\n  3. Remembers the user's choice locally between runs, via Qt's\n     QSettings (which just reads/writes a small config file / registry\n     key on disk \u2014 no server, no account, no internet required).\n\nSwap in a different persistence mechanism later if you want (e.g. a\nuser-profile file synced with the backend) \u2014 everything else in the\nUI only talks to this module, never to QSettings directly.\n\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom PySide6.QtCore import QSettings\nfrom PySide6.QtGui import QColor\nfrom PySide6.QtWidgets import QApplication\n\nSTYLES_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"styles\"\n\nORG_NAME = \"Memo\"\nAPP_NAME = \"MemoAssistant\"\nSETTINGS_KEY = \"appearance/theme\"\n\nDEFAULT_THEME = \"dark\"\n\n# key -> (display label, qss filename, swatch colors for the preferences UI)\nTHEMES = {\n    \"dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0B0F17\"), QColor(\"#111827\"), QColor(\"#5CC8FF\")],\n    },\n    \"light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light (White)\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FFFFFF\"), QColor(\"#F4F6F9\"), QColor(\"#2B8CE6\")],\n    },\n    \"light_blue\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light Blue\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light_blue.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#EAF3FC\"), QColor(\"#F4F9FE\"), QColor(\"#2F87D6\")],\n    },\n    \"midnight_purple\": {\n        \"label\": \"Midnight Purple\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_midnight_purple.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#120B1E\"), QColor(\"#1E1430\"), QColor(\"#B388FF\")],\n    },\n    \"forest\": {\n        \"label\": \"Forest\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_forest.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0E1710\"), QColor(\"#16241A\"), QColor(\"#5FD68A\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#002B36\"), QColor(\"#073642\"), QColor(\"#B58900\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Light\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FDF6E3\"), QColor(\"#EEE8D5\"), QColor(\"#268BD2\")],\n    },\n    \"high_contrast\": {\n        \"label\": \"High Contrast\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_high_contrast.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#000000\"), QColor(\"#1A1A1A\"), QColor(\"#FFD500\")],\n    },\n    \"rose_gold\": {\n        \"label\": \"Rose Gold\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_rose_gold.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#2A1B1E\"), QColor(\"#3A2529\"), QColor(\"#F0A9A0\")],\n    },\n    \"amber_terminal\": {\n        \"label\": \"Amber Terminal\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_amber_terminal.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0C0A00\"), QColor(\"#1A1400\"), QColor(\"#FFB000\")],\n    },\n}\n\n\ndef available_themes() -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Ordered list of valid theme keys.\"\"\"\n    return list(THEMES.keys())\n\n\ndef theme_label(key: str) -> str:\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"label\"]\n\n\ndef theme_swatch(key: str):\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"swatch\"]\n\n\ndef _theme_path(key: str) -> Path:\n    filename = THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"file\"]\n    return STYLES_DIR / filename\n\n\ndef load_theme_qss(key: str) -> str:\n    path = _theme_path(key)\n    if not path.exists():\n        path = _theme_path(DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n\ndef get_saved_theme() -> str:\n    \"\"\"Read the last-chosen theme from local settings (no backend call).\"\"\"\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    key = settings.value(SETTINGS_KEY, DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return key if key in THEMES else DEFAULT_THEME\n\n\ndef save_theme(key: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Persist the chosen theme locally so it's remembered next launch.\"\"\"\n    if key not in THEMES:\n        return\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    settings.setValue(SETTINGS_KEY, key)\n\n\ndef apply_theme(app: QApplication, key: str, persist: bool = True) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Apply a theme to the running app immediately, no restart needed.\"\"\"\n    app.setStyleSheet(load_theme_qss(key))\n    if persist:\n        save_theme(key)\n", "remaining_work": ["Inspect theme registration in theme_manager.py", "Create the custom QSS theme file", "Register the new theme in the manager and UI preferences dialog", "Verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "reading_existing_qss_template", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "ui/styles/theme_amber_terminal.qss", "op_name": "read"}, "last_tool_result": "/* =========================================================================\n   Memo \u2014 AI Assistant theme\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Centralized QSS. Every custom widget in this project is styled from\n   here via objectName / dynamic properties, so you can retint, resize\n   spacing, or restyle shadows and \"glass\" without touching Python.\n\n   Palette (feel free to change these and re-run \u2014 nothing in Python\n   hardcodes these values):\n     Background      #0C0A00\n     Surface         #1A1400\n     Glass           rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\n     Border          rgba(255,255,255,0.08)\n     Primary Text    #FFD37A\n     Secondary Text  #B98A2E\n     Accent          #FFB000\n     Accent 2        #FF8A00\n   ========================================================================= */\n\n* {\n    font-family: \"Cascadia Mono\", \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    outline: none;\n}\n\nQMainWindow, #centralwidget {\n    background-color: #0C0A00;\n}\n\nQWidget {\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n\nQToolTip {\n    background-color: #221A00;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar:vertical {\n    background: transparent;\n    width: 8px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n}\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n    min-height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n}\nQScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {\n    height: 0px;\n}\nQScrollBar:horizontal { height: 0px; }\n\nQSplitter::handle {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Sidebar \u2014 translucent glass panel\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n#Sidebar {\n    background-color: rgba(26,20,0,0.72);\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n}\n\n#brandGlyph {\n    color: #FFB000;\n    font-size: 18px;\n}\n#brandLabel {\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n}\n\n#newConversationButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,176,0,0.12);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.35);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #3A2600;\n}\n#newConversationButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,176,0,0.2);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.55);\n}\n#newConversationButton:pressed {\n    background-color: rgba(255,176,0,0.28);\n}\n\n#conversationSearch {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    selection-background-color: #FFB000;\n}\n#conversationSearch:focus {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.55);\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n}\n\n#conversationGroupLabel {\n    color: #8A661F;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 10px 6px 4px 6px;\n}\n\n#conversationItem {\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n#conversationItem:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n}\n#conversationItem[selected=\"true\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,176,0,0.14);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.3);\n}\n#conversationTitle {\n    color: #E0B15C;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: transparent;\n}\n#conversationIcon {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: transparent;\n}\n\n#utilitiesSeparator, #headerSeparator {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    max-height: 1px;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n#settingsButton, #preferencesButton, #attachmentsButton,\n#toolsUtilityButton, #helpButton {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background-color: transparent;\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    border: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n#settingsButton:hover, #preferencesButton:hover, #attachmentsButton:hover,\n#toolsUtilityButton:hover, #helpButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n\n#profileWidget {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n#profileAvatar {\n    background-color: rgba(255,138,0,0.18);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n}\n#profileName {\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n#profilePlan {\n    color: #8A661F;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Chat view \u2014 header, message list, empty state\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n#ChatView {\n    background-color: #0C0A00;\n}\n\n#headerWidget {\n    background-color: rgba(26,20,0,0.55);\n}\n#assistantNameLabel {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n#statusDot {\n    color: #7CFF6B;\n    font-size: 9px;\n}\n#statusLabel {\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#modelSelectorCombo {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    color: #E0B15C;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#modelSelectorCombo::drop-down {\n    border: none;\n    width: 18px;\n}\n#conversationActionsButton {\n    background-color: transparent;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n#conversationActionsButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n\n#messageScrollArea, #messagesContainer {\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n\n#emptyStateOrb {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #FF8A00;\n    qproperty-alignment: AlignCenter;\n}\n#emptyStateHeading {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    qproperty-alignment: AlignCenter;\n}\n#suggestionCard {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    color: #E0B15C;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#suggestionCard:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.3);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n\n/* Message bubbles */\n#messageBubble[role=\"user\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n}\n#messageBubble[role=\"ai\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n}\n#aiAvatar {\n    color: #FF8A00;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#messageAuthor {\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n#messageTimestamp {\n    color: #6B4F17;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n#messageBody {\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #FFDB93;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n}\n#messageActionButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n#messageActionButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n\n#typingIndicator #typingText {\n    color: #8A661F;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#typingDot {\n    color: #8A661F;\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n#typingDot[active=\"true\"] {\n    color: #FFB000;\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Composer \u2014 floating glass capsule\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n#composerCard {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.055);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n}\n#composerCard:focus-within {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.35);\n}\n\n#messageInput {\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    selection-background-color: #FFB000;\n}\n\n#charCountLabel {\n    color: #6B4F17;\n    font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n#attachmentButton, #toolsButton {\n    background-color: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    color: #B98A2E;\n    font-size: 15px;\n}\n#attachmentButton:hover, #toolsButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n}\n\n#sendButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    color: #6B4F17;\n    font-size: 15px;\n}\n#sendButton[active=\"true\"] {\n    background-color: #FFB000;\n    color: #140D00;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n#sendButton[active=\"true\"]:hover {\n    background-color: #FFC340;\n}\n#sendButton:disabled {\n    color: #4A3810;\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Preferences dialog\n   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */\n#PreferencesDialog {\n    background-color: #0C0A00;\n}\n#preferencesTitle {\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n#preferencesSectionLabel {\n    color: #8A661F;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n#themeOption {\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #E0B15C;\n}\n#themeOption:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n#themeOption[active=\"true\"] {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.55);\n    background-color: rgba(255,176,0,0.14);\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n#themeSwatch {\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);\n}\n#preferencesCloseButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    color: #FFD37A;\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n#preferencesCloseButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n", "remaining_work": ["Create the custom theme QSS file", "Register the theme in theme_manager.py", "Verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "created_theme_file", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "ui/styles/theme_thug_barber.qss || /* =========================================================================\n   Memo \u2014 Thug Life & Erotic Barber Hood Theme\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n   Palette:\n     Background      #120A0F\n     Surface         #21121C\n     Glass           rgba(255,105,180,0.08)\n     Border          rgba(255,20,147,0.2)\n     Primary Text    #FFD700\n     Secondary Text  #FF69B4\n     Accent          #FF1493\n     Accent 2        #FF4500\n   ========================================================================= */\n\n* {\n    font-family: \"Cascadia Mono\", \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    outline: none;\n}\n\nQMainWindow, #centralwidget {\n    background-color: #120A0F;\n}\n\nQWidget {\n    color: #FFD700;\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n\nQToolTip {\n    background-color: #26111D;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.3);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n}\n\nQScrollBar:vertical {\n    background: transparent;\n    width: 8px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n}\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical {\n    background: rgba(255,105,180,0.2);\n    min-height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\nQScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {\n    background: rgba(255,105,180,0.4);\n}\nQScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {\n    height: 0px;\n}\nQScrollBar:horizontal { height: 0px; }\n\nQSplitter::handle {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.15);\n}\n\n/* Sidebar */\n#Sidebar {\n    background-color: rgba(33,18,28,0.85);\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n}\n\n#brandGlyph {\n    color: #FF1493;\n    font-size: 18px;\n}\n#brandLabel {\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n#newConversationButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.15);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.4);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n#newConversationButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.25);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.7);\n}\n\n#conversationSearch {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    selection-background-color: #FF1493;\n}\n#conversationSearch:focus {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.8);\n}\n\n#conversationGroupLabel {\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 10px 6px 4px 6px;\n}\n\n#conversationItem {\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n#conversationItem:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.08);\n}\n#conversationItem[selected=\"true\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.5);\n}\n#conversationTitle {\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: transparent;\n}\n#conversationIcon {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: transparent;\n}\n\n#utilitiesSeparator, #headerSeparator {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    max-height: 1px;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n#settingsButton, #preferencesButton, #attachmentsButton,\n#toolsUtilityButton, #helpButton {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background-color: transparent;\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    border: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n#settingsButton:hover, #preferencesButton:hover, #attachmentsButton:hover,\n#toolsUtilityButton:hover, #helpButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n\n#profileWidget {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n}\n#profileAvatar {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n}\n#profileName {\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#profilePlan {\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n/* Chat view */\n#ChatView {\n    background-color: #120A0F;\n}\n#headerWidget {\n    background-color: rgba(33,18,28,0.7);\n}\n#assistantNameLabel {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n#statusDot {\n    color: #FF1493;\n    font-size: 9px;\n}\n#statusLabel {\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#modelSelectorCombo {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.3);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 12px;\n}\n#conversationActionsButton {\n    background-color: transparent;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 16px;\n}\n#conversationActionsButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n\n#messageScrollArea, #messagesContainer {\n    background-color: transparent;\n}\n\n#emptyStateOrb {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    color: #FF1493;\n    qproperty-alignment: AlignCenter;\n}\n#emptyStateHeading {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    qproperty-alignment: AlignCenter;\n}\n#suggestionCard {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#suggestionCard:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.5);\n}\n\n/* Message bubbles */\n#messageBubble[role=\"user\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.25);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n}\n#messageBubble[role=\"ai\"] {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.15);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n}\n#aiAvatar {\n    color: #FF1493;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n#messageAuthor {\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#messageTimestamp {\n    color: #8B3A62;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n#messageBody {\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #FFF8DC;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n}\n#messageActionButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n#messageActionButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n\n/* Composer */\n#composerCard {\n    background-color: rgba(33,18,28,0.8);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.3);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n}\n#composerCard:focus-within {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.8);\n}\n#messageInput {\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    selection-background-color: #FF1493;\n}\n#charCountLabel {\n    color: #8B3A62;\n    font-size: 10px;\n}\n#attachmentButton, #toolsButton {\n    background-color: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 15px;\n}\n#attachmentButton:hover, #toolsButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.15);\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n#sendButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    color: #8B3A62;\n    font-size: 15px;\n}\n#sendButton[active=\"true\"] {\n    background-color: #FF1493;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#sendButton[active=\"true\"]:hover {\n    background-color: #FF69B4;\n}\n\n/* Preferences dialog */\n#PreferencesDialog {\n    background-color: #120A0F;\n}\n#preferencesTitle {\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#preferencesSectionLabel {\n    color: #FF69B4;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n#themeOption {\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #FFD700;\n}\n#themeOption:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.1);\n}\n#themeOption[active=\"true\"] {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.8);\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.25);\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#themeSwatch {\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,20,147,0.4);\n}\n#preferencesCloseButton {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.2);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    color: #FFD700;\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n#preferencesCloseButton:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(255,20,147,0.4);\n}\n", "op_name": "write"}, "last_tool_result": "Successfully wrote to ui/styles/theme_thug_barber.qss", "remaining_work": ["Register theme in theme_manager.py", "Verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "registering_theme", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"cmd": "git status", "op_name": "exec"}, "last_tool_result": "[EXITCODE=0]On branch master\nYour branch is up to date with 'origin/master'.\n\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tmodified:   agents/__pycache__/skill_execution_loop.cpython-314.pyc\n\tmodified:   agents/__pycache__/skill_router.cpython-314.pyc\n\tmodified:   core/__pycache__/config.cpython-314.pyc\n\tmodified:   core/__pycache__/interface_new.cpython-314.pyc\n\tmodified:   ui/__pycache__/main.cpython-314.pyc\n\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n\tstate_log.net\n\tui/styles/theme_thug_barber.qss\n\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\n", "remaining_work": ["Add theme registration to ui/widgets/theme_manager.py", "Verify theme application"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "reading_theme_manager_for_patch", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "ui/widgets/theme_manager.py", "op_name": "read"}, "last_tool_result": "\"\"\"\ntheme_manager\n=============\n\nSmall, fully self-contained helper for switching the app's colour theme.\n\nThis is intentionally backend-independent: it never touches\n`core.interface` or makes any network/model call. It only:\n\n  1. Knows which .qss files exist and what to call them in the UI.\n  2. Applies a theme to the running QApplication.\n  3. Remembers the user's choice locally between runs, via Qt's\n     QSettings (which just reads/writes a small config file / registry\n     key on disk \u2014 no server, no account, no internet required).\n\nSwap in a different persistence mechanism later if you want (e.g. a\nuser-profile file synced with the backend) \u2014 everything else in the\nUI only talks to this module, never to QSettings directly.\n\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom PySide6.QtCore import QSettings\nfrom PySide6.QtGui import QColor\nfrom PySide6.QtWidgets import QApplication\n\nSTYLES_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"styles\"\n\nORG_NAME = \"Memo\"\nAPP_NAME = \"MemoAssistant\"\nSETTINGS_KEY = \"appearance/theme\"\n\nDEFAULT_THEME = \"dark\"\n\n# key -> (display label, qss filename, swatch colors for the preferences UI)\nTHEMES = {\n    \"dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0B0F17\"), QColor(\"#111827\"), QColor(\"#5CC8FF\")],\n    },\n    \"light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light (White)\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FFFFFF\"), QColor(\"#F4F6F9\"), QColor(\"#2B8CE6\")],\n    },\n    \"light_blue\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light Blue\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light_blue.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#EAF3FC\"), QColor(\"#F4F9FE\"), QColor(\"#2F87D6\")],\n    },\n    \"midnight_purple\": {\n        \"label\": \"Midnight Purple\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_midnight_purple.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#120B1E\"), QColor(\"#1E1430\"), QColor(\"#B388FF\")],\n    },\n    \"forest\": {\n        \"label\": \"Forest\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_forest.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0E1710\"), QColor(\"#16241A\"), QColor(\"#5FD68A\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#002B36\"), QColor(\"#073642\"), QColor(\"#B58900\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Light\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FDF6E3\"), QColor(\"#EEE8D5\"), QColor(\"#268BD2\")],\n    },\n    \"high_contrast\": {\n        \"label\": \"High Contrast\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_high_contrast.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#000000\"), QColor(\"#1A1A1A\"), QColor(\"#FFD500\")],\n    },\n    \"rose_gold\": {\n        \"label\": \"Rose Gold\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_rose_gold.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#2A1B1E\"), QColor(\"#3A2529\"), QColor(\"#F0A9A0\")],\n    },\n    \"amber_terminal\": {\n        \"label\": \"Amber Terminal\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_amber_terminal.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0C0A00\"), QColor(\"#1A1400\"), QColor(\"#FFB000\")],\n    },\n}\n\n\ndef available_themes() -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Ordered list of valid theme keys.\"\"\"\n    return list(THEMES.keys())\n\n\ndef theme_label(key: str) -> str:\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"label\"]\n\n\ndef theme_swatch(key: str):\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"swatch\"]\n\n\ndef _theme_path(key: str) -> Path:\n    filename = THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"file\"]\n    return STYLES_DIR / filename\n\n\ndef load_theme_qss(key: str) -> str:\n    path = _theme_path(key)\n    if not path.exists():\n        path = _theme_path(DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n\ndef get_saved_theme() -> str:\n    \"\"\"Read the last-chosen theme from local settings (no backend call).\"\"\"\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    key = settings.value(SETTINGS_KEY, DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return key if key in THEMES else DEFAULT_THEME\n\n\ndef save_theme(key: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Persist the chosen theme locally so it's remembered next launch.\"\"\"\n    if key not in THEMES:\n        return\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    settings.setValue(SETTINGS_KEY, key)\n\n\ndef apply_theme(app: QApplication, key: str, persist: bool = True) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Apply a theme to the running app immediately, no restart needed.\"\"\"\n    app.setStyleSheet(load_theme_qss(key))\n    if persist:\n        save_theme(key)\n", "remaining_work": ["Update theme_manager.py to include the new theme", "Verify changes"], "status": "in_progress"}
{"context": {}, "last_checkpoint": "updated_theme_manager", "last_question_to_user": null, "last_tool_call": {"args": "ui/widgets/theme_manager.py || \"\"\"\ntheme_manager\n=============\n\nSmall, fully self-contained helper for switching the app's colour theme.\n\nThis is intentionally backend-independent: it never touches\n`core.interface` or makes any network/model call. It only:\n\n  1. Knows which .qss files exist and what to call them in the UI.\n  2. Applies a theme to the running QApplication.\n  3. Remembers the user's choice locally between runs, via Qt's\n     QSettings (which just reads/writes a small config file / registry\n     key on disk \u2014 no server, no account, no internet required).\n\nSwap in a different persistence mechanism later if you want (e.g. a\nuser-profile file synced with the backend) \u2014 everything else in the\nUI only talks to this module, never to QSettings directly.\n\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom PySide6.QtCore import QSettings\nfrom PySide6.QtGui import QColor\nfrom PySide6.QtWidgets import QApplication\n\nSTYLES_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"styles\"\n\nORG_NAME = \"Memo\"\nAPP_NAME = \"MemoAssistant\"\nSETTINGS_KEY = \"appearance/theme\"\n\nDEFAULT_THEME = \"dark\"\n\n# key -> (display label, qss filename, swatch colors for the preferences UI)\nTHEMES = {\n    \"dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0B0F17\"), QColor(\"#111827\"), QColor(\"#5CC8FF\")],\n    },\n    \"light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light (White)\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FFFFFF\"), QColor(\"#F4F6F9\"), QColor(\"#2B8CE6\")],\n    },\n    \"light_blue\": {\n        \"label\": \"Light Blue\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_light_blue.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#EAF3FC\"), QColor(\"#F4F9FE\"), QColor(\"#2F87D6\")],\n    },\n    \"midnight_purple\": {\n        \"label\": \"Midnight Purple\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_midnight_purple.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#120B1E\"), QColor(\"#1E1430\"), QColor(\"#B388FF\")],\n    },\n    \"forest\": {\n        \"label\": \"Forest\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_forest.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0E1710\"), QColor(\"#16241A\"), QColor(\"#5FD68A\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_dark\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Dark\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_dark.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#002B36\"), QColor(\"#073642\"), QColor(\"#B58900\")],\n    },\n    \"solarized_light\": {\n        \"label\": \"Solarized Light\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_solarized_light.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#FDF6E3\"), QColor(\"#EEE8D5\"), QColor(\"#268BD2\")],\n    },\n    \"high_contrast\": {\n        \"label\": \"High Contrast\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_high_contrast.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#000000\"), QColor(\"#1A1A1A\"), QColor(\"#FFD500\")],\n    },\n    \"rose_gold\": {\n        \"label\": \"Rose Gold\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_rose_gold.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#2A1B1E\"), QColor(\"#3A2529\"), QColor(\"#F0A9A0\")],\n    },\n    \"amber_terminal\": {\n        \"label\": \"Amber Terminal\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_amber_terminal.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#0C0A00\"), QColor(\"#1A1400\"), QColor(\"#FFB000\")],\n    },\n    \"thug_barber\": {\n        \"label\": \"Thug Life & Erotic Barber Hood\",\n        \"file\": \"theme_thug_barber.qss\",\n        \"swatch\": [QColor(\"#120A0F\"), QColor(\"#21121C\"), QColor(\"#FF1493\")],\n    },\n}\n\n\ndef available_themes() -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Ordered list of valid theme keys.\"\"\"\n    return list(THEMES.keys())\n\n\ndef theme_label(key: str) -> str:\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"label\"]\n\n\ndef theme_swatch(key: str):\n    return THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"swatch\"]\n\n\ndef _theme_path(key: str) -> Path:\n    filename = THEMES.get(key, THEMES[DEFAULT_THEME])[\"file\"]\n    return STYLES_DIR / filename\n\n\ndef load_theme_qss(key: str) -> str:\n    path = _theme_path(key)\n    if not path.exists():\n        path = _theme_path(DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n\ndef get_saved_theme() -> str:\n    \"\"\"Read the last-chosen theme from local settings (no backend call).\"\"\"\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    key = settings.value(SETTINGS_KEY, DEFAULT_THEME)\n    return key if key in THEMES else DEFAULT_THEME\n\n\ndef save_theme(key: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Persist the chosen theme locally so it's remembered next launch.\"\n    if key not in THEMES:\n        return\n    settings = QSettings(ORG_NAME, APP_NAME)\n    settings.setValue(SETTINGS_KEY, key)\n\n\ndef apply_theme(app: QApplication, key: str, persist: bool = True) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Apply a theme to the running app immediately, no restart needed.\"\"\"\n    app.setStyleSheet(load_theme_qss(key))\n    if persist:\n        save_theme(key)\n", "op_name": "write"}, "last_tool_result": "Successfully wrote to ui/widgets/theme_manager.py", "remaining_work": ["Verify registration and test integration"], "status": "in_progress"}
